    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like the school's side always sounds so much more scientific and \"correct,\" while the parents' side is just dismissed as being against progress. do you think there's a way to tell if the school is actually acting in the kids' best interest, or if they're just following a political trend?",
